<title>SWITZERLAND: Saurer posts 1996 profit vs 1995 loss.</title>
<headline>Saurer posts 1996 profit vs 1995 loss.</headline>
<dateline>ARBON, Switzerland 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			50 profit	 vs 75 loss</p>
<p> Op profit			63 profit	 vs 58 loss</p>
<p> Sales			    1,671	     vs 1,726</p>
<p>Note - Textile machinery and automobile component maker Saurer AG said in a letter shareholders that it would propose a capital pay back of 15 Swiss francs per share.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate on the pay back.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
